  (23679, 124, 'Hello everyone.', 18.023, 20.217, NULL),
  (23680, 124, 'I''m Sam,', 20.217, 21.634, NULL),
  (23681, 124, 'and I just turned 17.', 21.634, 24.401, NULL),
  (23682, 124, 'A few years ago,
before my freshman year in High School,', 24.401, 27.648, NULL),
  (23683, 124, 'I wanted to play snare drum
in the Foxboro High School Marching Band,', 27.648, 32.852, NULL),
  (23684, 124, 'and it was a dream
that I just had to accomplish.', 32.852, 35.589, NULL),
  (23685, 124, 'But each snare drum and harness', 35.589, 37.852, NULL),
  (23686, 124, 'weighed about 40 pounds each,', 37.852, 40.155, NULL),
  (23687, 124, 'and I have a disease called Progeria.', 40.155, 42.770, NULL),
  (23688, 124, 'So just to give you an idea,
I weigh only about 50 pounds.', 42.770, 46.858, NULL),
  (23689, 124, 'So, logistically, I really couldn''t carry
a regular sized snare drum,', 46.858, 51.615, NULL),
  (23690, 124, 'and because of this the band director
assigned me to play', 51.615, 55.654, NULL),
  (23691, 124, 'pit percussion during the halftime show.', 55.654, 59.005, NULL),
  (23692, 124, 'Now pit percussion was fun.', 59.005, 61.110, NULL),
  (23693, 124, 'It involved some really cool
auxiliary percussion instruments,', 61.110, 64.803, NULL),
  (23694, 124, 'like the bongos, timpani,', 64.803, 68.623, NULL),
  (23695, 124, 'and timbales, and cowbell.', 68.623, 71.107, NULL),
  (23696, 124, 'So it was fun,', 71.107, 73.318, NULL),
  (23697, 124, 'but it involved no marching,
and I was just so devastated.', 73.318, 78.420, NULL),
  (23698, 124, 'However, nothing was going 
to stop me', 78.420, 80.914, NULL),
  (23699, 124, 'from playing snare drum
with the marching band', 80.914, 83.585, NULL),
  (23700, 124, 'in the halftime show.', 83.585, 85.010, NULL),
  (23701, 124, 'So my family and I worked
with an engineer to design', 85.010, 89.865, NULL),
  (23702, 124, 'a snare drum harness', 89.865, 91.793, NULL),
  (23703, 124, 'that would be lighter,
and easier for me to carry.', 91.793, 95.580, NULL),
  (23704, 124, 'So after continuous work, we made', 95.580, 99.638, NULL),
  (23705, 124, 'a snare drum apparatus
that weighs only about 6 pounds.', 99.638, 103.859, NULL),
  (23706, 124, '(Applause)', 103.859, 108.129, NULL),
  (23707, 124, 'I just want to give you some more
information about Progeria.', 108.129, 112.427, NULL),
  (23708, 124, 'It affects only about
350 kids today, worldwide.', 112.427, 118.340, NULL),
  (23709, 124, 'So it''s pretty rare,', 118.340, 120.880, NULL),
  (23710, 124, 'and the effects of Progeria include:', 120.880, 123.335, NULL),
  (23711, 124, 'tight skin, lack of weight gain,
stunted growth,', 123.335, 127.408, NULL),
  (23712, 124, 'and heart disease.', 127.408, 129.011, NULL),
  (23713, 124, 'Last year my Mom 
and her team of scientists', 129.011, 132.586, NULL),
  (23714, 124, 'published the first successful
Progeria Treatment Study,', 132.586, 136.725, NULL),
  (23715, 124, 'and because of this
I was interviewed on NPR,', 136.725, 139.460, NULL),
  (23716, 124, 'and John Hamilton asked me
the question:', 139.460, 142.006, NULL),
  (23717, 124, '"What is the most important thing', 142.006, 144.272, NULL),
  (23718, 124, 'that people should know about you?"', 144.272, 146.538, NULL),
  (23719, 124, 'And my answer was simply that', 146.538, 149.264, NULL),
  (23720, 124, 'I have a very happy life.', 149.264, 151.691, NULL),
  (23721, 124, '(Applause)', 151.691, 155.762, NULL),
  (23722, 124, 'So even though
there are many obstacles in my life,', 155.762, 159.663, NULL),
  (23723, 124, 'with a lot of them
being created by Progeria,', 159.663, 162.533, NULL),
  (23724, 124, 'I don''t want people to feel bad for me.', 162.533, 165.095, NULL),
  (23725, 124, 'I don''t think about
these obstacles all the time,', 165.095, 167.802, NULL),
  (23726, 124, 'and I''m able to overcome
most of them anyway.', 167.802, 171.007, NULL),
  (23727, 124, 'So I’m here today, to share with you
my philosophy for a happy life.', 171.007, 176.132, NULL),
  (23728, 124, 'So, for me,
there are 3 aspects to this philosophy.', 176.132, 180.757, NULL),
  (23729, 124, 'So this is a quote
from the famous Ferris Bueller.', 180.757, 184.830, NULL),
  (23730, 124, 'The first aspect to my philosophy is that', 184.830, 188.516, NULL),
  (23731, 124, 'I’m okay with what I ultimately can’t do', 188.516, 191.552, NULL),
  (23732, 124, 'because there is so much I can do.', 191.552, 194.032, NULL),
  (23733, 124, 'Now people sometimes 
ask me questions like,', 194.032, 196.799, NULL),
  (23734, 124, '"Isn’t it hard living with Progeria?" or', 196.799, 199.252, NULL),
  (23735, 124, '"What daily challenges
of Progeria do you face?"', 199.252, 202.569, NULL),
  (23736, 124, 'And I’d like to say that,
even though I have Progeria,', 202.569, 206.053, NULL),
  (23737, 124, 'most of my time
is spent thinking about things', 206.053, 208.686, NULL),
  (23738, 124, 'that have nothing to do
with Progeria at all.', 208.686, 211.534, NULL),
  (23739, 124, 'Now this doesn’t mean that I ignore
the negative aspects of these obstacles.', 211.534, 216.435, NULL),
  (23740, 124, 'When I can’t do something like', 216.435, 218.491, NULL),
  (23741, 124, 'run a long distance,
or go on an intense roller coaster,', 218.491, 222.557, NULL),
  (23742, 124, 'I know what I’m missing out on.', 222.557, 224.583, NULL),
  (23743, 124, 'But instead,
I choose to focus on the activities', 224.583, 228.499, NULL),
  (23744, 124, 'that I can do through things
that I’m passionate about,', 228.499, 232.276, NULL),
  (23745, 124, 'like scouting, or music, or comic books,', 232.276, 235.791, NULL),
  (23746, 124, 'or any of my favorite Boston sports teams.', 235.791, 238.756, NULL),
  (23747, 124, 'Yeah, so --
(Laughter)', 238.756, 241.862, NULL),
  (23748, 124, 'However, sometimes I need to find
a different way to do something', 241.862, 246.001, NULL),
  (23749, 124, 'by making adjustments,', 246.001, 247.712, NULL),
  (23750, 124, 'and I want to put those things
in the "can do" category.', 247.712, 251.799, NULL),
  (23751, 124, 'Kind of like you saw
with the drum earlier.', 251.799, 254.803, NULL),
  (23752, 124, 'So here’s a clip', 254.803, 256.512, NULL),
  (23753, 124, 'with me playing Spider-Man', 256.512, 258.951, NULL),
  (23754, 124, 'with the Foxboro High School 
Marching Band', 258.951, 261.760, NULL),
  (23755, 124, 'at halftime a couple of years ago.', 261.760, 263.864, NULL),
