  (24402, 126, 'Couple of wavy lines,', 576.282, 578.022, NULL),
  (24403, 126, 'little boat could be a metaphor
to represent we''re all in this together.', 581.062, 586.942, NULL),
  (24404, 126, 'So that, if that was just drawn
in the presentation,', 586.942, 589.782, NULL),
  (24405, 126, 'would really stay
in the memory, wouldn''t it?', 589.782, 592.242, NULL),
  (24406, 126, 'Yeah.', 592.242, 593.082, NULL),
  (24407, 126, 'But the third example is -
you shouldn''t have favorites, should you?', 593.082, 596.292, NULL),
  (24408, 126, 'This is my favorite.', 596.292, 598.042, NULL),
  (24409, 126, 'Have you ever been at the party
when someone asks you what you do?', 598.042, 601.262, NULL),
  (24410, 126, 'It gets a little bit skeptical
when people ask me that.', 601.262, 603.852, NULL),
  (24411, 126, 'This lady said to me, well -', 603.852, 605.772, NULL),
  (24412, 126, 'I said, "I do a little bit of training,
and I teach people to draw,"', 605.772, 609.012, NULL),
  (24413, 126, 'and she said, "Would you come along
and do some for our group?"', 609.012, 613.472, NULL),
  (24414, 126, 'She said, "I work with some people"
- she was a volunteer -', 613.472, 616.542, NULL),
  (24415, 126, 'a group of people
who have suffered strokes.', 616.542, 619.292, NULL),
  (24416, 126, 'So I said, "Sure, I could spare
some time for that."', 619.292, 622.472, NULL),
  (24417, 126, 'So I said I would,
and I booked the time in.', 622.472, 624.532, NULL),
  (24418, 126, 'Have you ever done that?', 624.532, 625.682, NULL),
  (24419, 126, 'You get near of that time', 625.682, 626.882, NULL),
  (24420, 126, 'and you think,
"What have I let myself in for here?"', 626.882, 629.362, NULL),
  (24421, 126, '"Will I be able to do it?"', 629.362, 630.772, NULL),
  (24422, 126, 'I thought, "What could I
do with them?" you see.', 630.772, 633.772, NULL),
  (24423, 126, '"I know. I''ll do my cartoon drawing.
They''ll like that."', 633.772, 637.882, NULL),
  (24424, 126, 'But then, as I got near of the time,
I got more apprehensive,', 637.882, 640.802, NULL),
  (24425, 126, 'because then I was thinking,', 640.802, 642.162, NULL),
  (24426, 126, '"I''ve worked with children,
with all sorts of adults;', 642.162, 644.662, NULL),
  (24427, 126, 'I''ve never worked with a group like this."', 644.662, 646.672, NULL),
  (24428, 126, 'It turns out it was all part
of a charity called TALK.', 646.672, 650.512, NULL),
  (24429, 126, 'This TALK charity is a wonderful charity
that helps people who''ve suffered strokes,', 650.512, 655.492, NULL),
  (24430, 126, 'but have a particular condition
known as aphasia.', 655.492, 659.492, NULL),
  (24431, 126, 'You might have heard of aphasia,
sometimes called dysphasia.', 659.492, 663.062, NULL),
  (24432, 126, 'The key thing is it affects
their ability to communicate.', 663.062, 667.252, NULL),
  (24433, 126, 'So, for example, they might have trouble', 667.252, 669.512, NULL),
  (24434, 126, 'reading, writing, speaking,
or understanding.', 669.512, 673.062, NULL),
  (24435, 126, 'It can be quite an isolating condition;', 673.062, 676.292, NULL),
  (24436, 126, 'it can be very, very frustrating
and can lead to a loss of confidence.', 676.292, 680.642, NULL),
  (24437, 126, 'Anyway, so I prepared all this stuff,
what to do for this session', 680.642, 684.772, NULL),
  (24438, 126, '- for a couple of hours,
tea break in the middle -', 684.772, 687.132, NULL),
  (24439, 126, 'and I got more apprehensive.', 687.132, 689.962, NULL),
  (24440, 126, 'But actually, I needn''t have worried,', 689.962, 691.832, NULL),
  (24441, 126, 'because I''m going to show you now
the work that they did.', 691.832, 694.542, NULL),
  (24442, 126, 'It was one of the best things
I''ve ever done.', 694.542, 697.292, NULL),
  (24443, 126, 'I''m going to show you the first slide.', 697.292, 699.754, NULL),
  (24444, 126, 'I taught them Spike,
just like I did for you,', 699.754, 702.644, NULL),
  (24445, 126, 'and I want you to see the reaction
on their faces when they did this.', 702.644, 706.204, NULL),
  (24446, 126, '(Audience) Oh.', 706.745, 709.505, NULL),
  (24447, 126, 'What you can see here
are two of the stroke recoverers', 709.505, 712.065, NULL),
  (24448, 126, 'on the left and right,', 712.065, 713.195, NULL),
  (24449, 126, 'and one of the volunteer
helpers in the center.', 713.195, 715.505, NULL),
  (24450, 126, 'Each stroke recoverer, there are about 36
in the room with volunteers as well,', 716.252, 720.602, NULL),
  (24451, 126, 'there''s one-to-one helpers.', 720.602, 722.812, NULL),
  (24452, 126, 'You can just see the delight
on their faces, can''t you?', 722.812, 725.512, NULL),
  (24453, 126, 'Let''s look at another picture.', 725.512, 727.732, NULL),
  (24454, 126, 'This is a gentleman called David,
and he''s holding up his picture,', 728.746, 732.056, NULL),
  (24455, 126, 'and you can tell it was the picture
of Spike, can''t you?', 732.056, 734.786, NULL),
  (24456, 126, 'In fact, I think he''s drawn Spike
even better there.', 734.786, 738.046, NULL),
  (24457, 126, 'But what I didn''t realize
until even after the session', 738.046, 741.536, NULL),
  (24458, 126, 'was that the number of the people
in this session, including David,', 741.536, 744.706, NULL),
  (24459, 126, 'were drawing with their wrong hand.', 744.706, 747.246, NULL),
  (24460, 126, 'David''s stroke meant that it affected
the right side of his body,', 747.922, 751.752, NULL),
  (24461, 126, 'and he drew with his left hand,
as many did.', 751.752, 754.542, NULL),
  (24462, 126, 'Nobody mentioned it to me,
nobody complained.', 754.542, 757.232, NULL),
  (24463, 126, 'They just got on with it.', 757.232, 759.032, NULL),
  (24464, 126, 'It was an inspirational session for me.', 759.032, 761.172, NULL),
  (24465, 126, 'It was quite a humbling session,', 761.172, 763.232, NULL),
  (24466, 126, 'one of the best things
I felt I''ve ever done.', 763.232, 765.512, NULL),
  (24467, 126, 'At the end of it, I had a lovely email
from doctor Mike Jordan,', 765.512, 769.512, NULL),
  (24468, 126, 'and he''s the chair of the TALK group;', 769.512, 771.772, NULL),
  (24469, 126, 'happens to be a medical doctor,
but he''s the chair of the group.', 771.772, 774.822, NULL),
  (24470, 126, 'He wrote to me, and I''m quoting, he said,', 774.822, 776.772, NULL),
  (24471, 126, '"Our recoverers learned today
that they can draw.', 776.772, 781.012, NULL),
  (24472, 126, 'It''s a bit more than that;', 781.012, 782.532, NULL),
  (24473, 126, 'this sort of activity
really builds their confidence."', 782.532, 785.792, NULL),
  (24474, 126, 'So I was happy, he was happy,
everyone was happy,', 785.792, 788.542, NULL),
  (24475, 126, 'they''ve invited me back again,', 788.542, 789.972, NULL),
  (24476, 126, 'and I go in there now
about every three or four months.', 789.972, 793.062, NULL),
  (24477, 126, 'So it''s great. I thought
that was a lovely example to share.', 793.062, 796.112, NULL),
  (24478, 126, 'Fancy one more drawing?', 796.112, 797.382, NULL),
  (24479, 126, '(Audience) Yes.', 797.382, 798.302, NULL),
  (24480, 126, 'Here we go. Grab your pens.', 798.302, 800.502, NULL),
  (24481, 126, 'Here we go. Right.', 804.121, 806.561, NULL),
