  (24943, 128, 'It''s called modelling and I''ve been 
looking at language learning', 207.512, 210.576, NULL),
  (24944, 128, 'and modelling language learning 
for about 15 to 20 years now.', 210.576, 214.830, NULL),
  (24945, 128, 'And my conclusion, 
my observation from this is', 215.568, 218.282, NULL),
  (24946, 128, 'that any adult can learn a second 
language to fluency inside six months.', 218.282, 222.572, NULL),
  (24947, 128, 'Now when I say this, most people 
