  (25229, 129, 'in people''s living room,
whatever room you want to be in,', 44.073, 47.604, NULL),
  (25230, 129, 'if I''m there, I will help you get whatever
you want by any means necessary.', 47.604, 52.280, NULL),
  (25231, 129, 'For the last three years –
I host a syndicated radio show.', 52.280, 56.471, NULL),
  (25232, 129, 'Five days a week,
I go live in forty cities', 56.471, 59.198, NULL),
  (25233, 129, 'and I talk to men and women
across America who feel stuck.', 59.198, 63.426, NULL),
  (25234, 129, 'Do you know that a third of Americans
