  (25260, 129, 'Losing your manboobs,
so you can hook up with somebody,', 148.761, 152.122, NULL),
  (25261, 129, 'now that''s motivation.
(Laughter)', 152.122, 155.575, NULL),
  (25262, 129, 'So, I want to know: What do you want?', 155.575, 159.750, NULL),
  (25263, 129, 'Do you want to lose weight?
Do you want to triple your income?', 159.750, 163.252, NULL),
  (25264, 129, 'Do you want to start a nonprofit?
Do you want to find love?', 163.252, 167.071, NULL),
  (25265, 129, 'What is it? Get it, right here.', 167.071, 169.168, NULL),
  (25266, 129, 'You know what it is, don''t analyze it
