  (25457, 129, '(Laughter)', 848.484, 849.443, NULL),
  (25458, 129, 'You weren''t drunk!
That was your brain on autopilot.', 849.443, 853.354, NULL),
  (25459, 129, 'It was functioning just at this level.', 853.354, 856.464, NULL),
  (25460, 129, 'And the problem with your mind
is that anytime', 856.464, 859.335, NULL),
  (25461, 129, 'you do anything that''s different
from your normal routine,', 859.335, 862.852, NULL),
  (25462, 129, 'guess what your brain does —
emergency brake!', 862.852, 866.189, NULL),
  (25463, 129, 'And it has that reaction for everything.
Everything!', 866.189, 869.330, NULL),
  (25464, 129, 'You walk into the kitchen
and see', 869.330, 870.975, NULL),
  (25465, 129, 'everybody''s left their breakfast
dishes for you.', 870.975, 873.291, NULL),
  (25466, 129, 'And you think for the hundredth time,
"I''m going to kill them.', 873.291, 876.232, NULL),
  (25467, 129, 'In fact I''m gonna leave it here
and I''m going to make them do it."', 876.232, 879.998, NULL),
  (25468, 129, 'But that''s not your normal routine, is it?', 879.998, 882.354, NULL),
  (25469, 129, 'So your mind goes: emergency brake!', 882.354, 884.462, NULL),
  (25470, 129, 'And you go right into autopilot.', 884.462, 886.012, NULL),
  (25471, 129, '"I''ll just load it, and be pissed,
and then not have sex.', 886.012, 888.753, NULL),
  (25472, 129, 'That''s what I''m going to do."
(Laughter) (Applause)', 888.753, 893.776, NULL),
  (25473, 129, 'So, when I say "force",', 894.669, 896.868, NULL),
  (25474, 129, 'anything that''s a break from your routine
is going to require force.', 896.868, 901.971, NULL),
  (25475, 129, 'And if you think about your life,', 902.018, 904.556, NULL),
  (25476, 129, 'it''s kind of funny because we are kids
and then we become adults,', 904.556, 909.167, NULL),
  (25477, 129, 'and we spend so much time
trying to push our life', 909.167, 911.407, NULL),
  (25478, 129, 'into some sort of stable routine,', 911.407, 913.647, NULL),
  (25479, 129, 'and then we grow bored of it!', 913.647, 915.888, NULL),
  (25480, 129, 'You wake up at the same time every day,
you have largely the same breakfast,', 915.888, 919.506, NULL),
  (25481, 129, 'you drive to work the same way,
show up at work, look busy,', 919.506, 922.470, NULL),
  (25482, 129, 'avoid making calls,
update Facebook,', 922.470, 924.845, NULL),
  (25483, 129, 'you attend a meeting
and doodle the whole time,', 924.845, 927.220, NULL),
  (25484, 129, 'go back and update Facebook,
make plans for the evening,', 927.220, 929.865, NULL),
  (25485, 129, 'you look busy some more,
then drive home the same way,', 929.865, 932.387, NULL),
  (25486, 129, 'you eat largely the same dinner
or a variety of it,', 932.387, 934.962, NULL),
  (25487, 129, 'you watch the same kind of media,', 934.962, 936.873, NULL),
  (25488, 129, 'and then you go to bed,
and do the same thing all over again!', 936.873, 939.642, NULL),
  (25489, 129, 'No wonder you''re bored out
of your mind!', 939.642, 941.909, NULL),
  (25490, 129, 'It''s the routine that''s killing you.', 941.909, 944.659, NULL),
  (25491, 129, 'I have this theory about
why people get stuck in life.', 944.659, 948.075, NULL),
  (25492, 129, 'So, most of you''ve probably taken
your Basic Psych 101 class,', 948.075, 951.893, NULL),
  (25493, 129, 'and you''ve bumped into
Abraham Maslow''s "Hierarchy of Needs"?', 951.893, 956.515, NULL),
  (25494, 129, 'Well, your body is kinda cool.
Because you have these basic needs.', 956.515, 961.893, NULL),
  (25495, 129, 'And your body is wired
to send you signals.', 961.893, 966.660, NULL),
  (25496, 129, 'If you need food, what do you feel?', 966.660, 970.974, NULL),
  (25497, 129, 'If you need water, what do you feel?', 971.205, 974.187, NULL),
  (25498, 129, 'If you need sex, what do you feel?
(Laughter) Thank you.', 974.187, 978.841, NULL),
  (25499, 129, 'I think when you feel stuck
or dissatisfied in your life,', 980.295, 984.527, NULL),
  (25500, 129, 'it''s a signal.', 984.538, 986.959, NULL),
  (25501, 129, 'And it''s not a signal
that your life is broken.', 986.959, 990.293, NULL),
  (25502, 129, 'It''s a signal that one of your most
basic needs are not being met.', 990.293, 995.104, NULL),
  (25503, 129, 'Your need for exploration.', 995.231, 997.611, NULL),
  (25504, 129, 'Everything about your life,
about your body, grows!', 997.611, 1001.270, NULL),
  (25505, 129, 'Your cells regenerate,
your hair, your nails,', 1001.270, 1003.941, NULL),
  (25506, 129, 'everything grows for your entire life.', 1003.941, 1007.236, NULL),
  (25507, 129, 'And your soul needs exploration
and growth.', 1007.236, 1011.060, NULL),
  (25508, 129, 'And the only way you''ll get it is
by forcing yourself to be uncomfortable.', 1011.060, 1016.678, NULL),
  (25509, 129, 'Forcing yourself to get outside,', 1017.694, 1021.356, NULL),
  (25510, 129, 'out of your head.
Thank you.', 1022.583, 1024.734, NULL),
  (25511, 129, 'If you''re in your head,
you''re behind enemy lines.', 1024.734, 1027.040, NULL),
  (25512, 129, 'That is not God talking, okay?
It''s not!', 1027.040, 1030.670, NULL),
  (25513, 129, 'In fact, if I put a speaker on it
and we broadcast what you say to yourself,', 1030.670, 1034.496, NULL),
  (25514, 129, 'we would institutionalize you.
(Laughter)', 1034.496, 1038.322, NULL),
  (25515, 129, 'You would not hang out with people
that talk to you', 1038.322, 1040.699, NULL),
  (25516, 129, 'the way you talk to yourself.', 1040.699, 1042.815, NULL),
  (25517, 129, 'So get out of your head!', 1042.815, 1045.455, NULL),
  (25518, 129, 'Your feelings!
Your feelings are screwing you!', 1045.455, 1049.566, NULL),
  (25519, 129, 'I don''t care how you feel!
I care about what you want!', 1049.566, 1053.983, NULL),
  (25520, 129, 'And if you listen to how you feel,', 1053.983, 1056.827, NULL),
  (25521, 129, 'when it comes to what you want –
you will not get it.', 1056.827, 1060.779, NULL),
  (25522, 129, 'Because you will never feel like it.', 1061.093, 1064.159, NULL),
  (25523, 129, 'And you need to get outside
your comfort zone.', 1064.650, 1067.443, NULL),
  (25524, 129, 'It''s not about taking risks,', 1067.443, 1069.694, NULL),
  (25525, 129, 'it''s about getting outside
your comfort zone.', 1069.694, 1073.272, NULL),
  (25526, 129, 'Those first three seconds when
you push yourself out of bed, they blow.', 1073.272, 1078.447, NULL),
  (25527, 129, 'But once you''re up, it''s great.', 1078.815, 1082.315, NULL),
  (25528, 129, 'Those first three seconds when
you''re sitting here in a stadium like this', 1082.315, 1086.816, NULL),
  (25529, 129, 'and somebody says,
"Get up and come dance,"', 1086.816, 1089.307, NULL),
  (25530, 129, 'and you think,
"Oh, I should do that,"', 1089.307, 1091.798, NULL),
  (25531, 129, 'and then you''re like, "Uhmm."', 1091.798, 1094.290, NULL),
  (25532, 129, 'That experience that you had
when you had the impulse to do it', 1094.290, 1099.286, NULL),
  (25533, 129, 'and then you didn''t do
the activation energy', 1100.233, 1103.776, NULL),
  (25534, 129, 'required to force yourself,', 1103.867, 1106.279, NULL),
  (25535, 129, 'your emergency brake got pulled –
"I''m sitting right here.', 1106.856, 1109.613, NULL),
  (25536, 129, 'I''m not going up with those
crazy people, I don''t like to dance..."', 1109.613, 1113.682, NULL),
  (25537, 129, 'What happened for me is
I came up, and I bumped into Rachel,', 1114.422, 1117.385, NULL),
  (25538, 129, 'and then we started talking,
and next thing you know, she''s tweeting.', 1117.385, 1121.441, NULL),
  (25539, 129, 'And we''re friends.
And – boom! Get outside.', 1121.441, 1125.993, NULL),
  (25540, 129, 'That''s where the magic is.', 1125.993, 1127.832, NULL),
  (25541, 129, 'That''s where the one
in four hundred trillion exists.', 1127.832, 1133.504, NULL),
  (25542, 129, 'So everything I do –
oh, OK, this is the last part. Sorry.', 1134.181, 1138.277, NULL),
  (25543, 129, 'So one more thing that you can use,
I call it the five-second-rule.', 1138.277, 1142.259, NULL),
  (25544, 129, 'Your mind can process a facial expression
in 33 milliseconds.', 1142.459, 1147.578, NULL),
  (25545, 129, 'It can move pretty damn quick.', 1150.558, 1153.197, NULL),
  (25546, 129, 'The other thing that it does very quickly', 1153.380, 1156.262, NULL),
  (25547, 129, 'is if you have one of those little
