  (25589, 130, 'Transcriber: Jaime Ochoa
Reviewer: Elisabeth Buffard', 0.000, 7.000, NULL),
  (25590, 130, 'In my past life as a soccer coach,', 6.955, 8.711, NULL),
  (25591, 130, 'once you won a national championship,', 8.711, 10.361, NULL),
  (25592, 130, 'everyone wants to come play for you.', 10.361, 12.109, NULL),
  (25593, 130, 'Really not true.', 12.109, 13.403, NULL),
  (25594, 130, 'Once you paid them
$ 25,000 a year in scholarships,', 13.403, 17.233, NULL),
  (25595, 130, 'everybody wants 
to come play for you.', 17.233, 18.870, NULL),
  (25596, 130, 'And parents would always
come to me and they''d say:', 18.870, 20.882, NULL),
  (25597, 130, '"Okay, my son or my daughter
wants to come play at your university,', 20.882, 24.298, NULL),
  (25598, 130, 'what is it that we have to do?', 24.298, 26.085, NULL),
  (25599, 130, 'You know, what are you looking for?"', 26.085, 27.478, NULL),
  (25600, 130, 'And being the Socratic
professor that I am,', 27.478, 29.396, NULL),
  (25601, 130, 'I say, well, what does
your son or daughter do?', 29.396, 31.370, NULL),
  (25602, 130, 'What do they do really well
that we''d be interested in?', 31.370, 33.778, NULL),
  (25603, 130, 'And typically their answers are,
well, they''ve got great vision.', 33.778, 36.863, NULL),
  (25604, 130, 'They''re really good.', 36.863, 37.845, NULL),
  (25605, 130, 'They can see the entire field.', 37.845, 39.005, NULL),
  (25606, 130, 'Or, my daughter is the fastest player,
there''s nobody that can beat her.', 39.005, 42.620, NULL),
  (25607, 130, 'Or, my son''s got a great left-footer.', 42.620, 45.079, NULL),
  (25608, 130, 'Really great in the air
and can hit every ball.', 45.079, 47.484, NULL),
  (25609, 130, 'I''m like: "Yeah, not bad;', 47.484, 50.197, NULL),
  (25610, 130, 'but to be quite honest with you,', 50.197, 52.250, NULL),
  (25611, 130, 'those are the last things
I''m looking for.', 52.250, 54.298, NULL),
  (25612, 130, 'The most important thing?', 54.298, 55.695, NULL),
  (25613, 130, 'Self-confidence."', 57.024, 58.157, NULL),
  (25614, 130, 'Without that skill, and I use
the word skill intentionally,', 58.157, 61.890, NULL),
  (25615, 130, 'without that skill, we are
useless as a soccer player.', 61.890, 66.267, NULL),
  (25616, 130, 'Because when you lose sight
or belief in yourself,', 66.267, 69.945, NULL),
  (25617, 130, 'we''re done for.', 69.945, 71.495, NULL),
  (25618, 130, 'I use the definition 
of self-confidence', 71.495, 73.486, NULL),
  (25619, 130, 'to be the ability or the belief', 73.486, 76.024, NULL),
  (25620, 130, 'to believe in yourself,
to accomplish any task,', 76.534, 80.282, NULL),
  (25621, 130, 'no matter the odds,
no matter the difficulty,', 80.282, 83.019, NULL),
  (25622, 130, 'no matter the adversity.', 83.019, 84.241, NULL),
  (25623, 130, 'The belief that you can
accomplished it, self-confidence.', 84.241, 88.536, NULL),
  (25624, 130, 'Some of you are saying,
"Great, I don''t have it. I''m so shy.', 88.536, 91.289, NULL),
  (25625, 130, 'I''ll never do that, bla, bla, bla."', 91.289, 93.324, NULL),
  (25626, 130, 'And you start to drag
all the way down here.', 93.324, 97.290, NULL),
  (25627, 130, 'But, I use the word skill', 97.290, 99.500, NULL),
  (25628, 130, 'because', 99.500, 100.350, NULL),
  (25629, 130, 'I believe it can be trained.', 100.350, 101.881, NULL),
  (25630, 130, 'And I''ll show you a couple
of ways in which we do.', 101.881, 104.121, NULL),
  (25631, 130, 'Hopefully I won''t run out of time.', 104.121, 105.554, NULL),
  (25632, 130, 'I don''t use any slides', 105.554, 106.437, NULL),
  (25633, 130, 'because my speech always goes
here, or here, or here.', 106.437, 108.958, NULL),
  (25634, 130, 'So we''ll see which way we get to.', 108.958, 110.802, NULL),
  (25635, 130, 'The easiest way
to build self-confidence:', 110.802, 113.456, NULL),
  (25636, 130, 'there''s no magic button.', 113.456, 114.633, NULL),
  (25637, 130, 'I can''t say: "Hey, this plane
is going down,', 114.633, 116.125, NULL),
  (25638, 130, 'who can fly?', 116.125, 116.897, NULL),
  (25639, 130, 'Put your hand up."', 116.897, 117.661, NULL),
  (25640, 130, '"I can, I''m confident!"', 117.661, 119.381, NULL),
  (25641, 130, '(Laughter)', 119.381, 121.926, NULL),
  (25642, 130, 'Repetition, repetition, repetition.', 121.926, 125.459, NULL),
  (25643, 130, 'Right?', 125.459, 126.447, NULL),
  (25644, 130, 'What does Malcom Gladwell call it,
the 10,000-hour rule?', 126.447, 129.573, NULL),
  (25645, 130, 'There''s no magic button.', 129.573, 130.579, NULL),
  (25646, 130, 'I recruited a goalie from Colombia,
