Reviewer: Ariana Bleau Lugo', 0.000, 7.000, NULL),
  (26232, 132, 'So this is a hotel room,
kind of like the one I''m staying in.', 11.861, 15.587, NULL),
  (26233, 132, 'I get bored sometimes.', 15.587, 17.731, NULL),
  (26234, 132, 'A room like this has not a lot
to offer for entertainment.', 17.731, 21.158, NULL),
  (26235, 132, 'But for a hacker, it gets a little
