  (27955, 137, 'Because even though
those words are very powerful', 790.616, 794.081, NULL),
  (27956, 137, '- and very powerful to a person like me -', 794.082, 797.731, NULL),
  (27957, 137, 'I don''t need them to hear it from him', 797.732, 799.959, NULL),
  (27958, 137, 'because I have already
heard them from myself.', 799.960, 802.747, NULL),
  (27959, 137, 'The way I see it is like I took myself
