  (27967, 138, 'Translator: Cihan Ekmekçi
Reviewer: Leonardo Silva', 0.000, 7.000, NULL),
  (27968, 138, 'Six years ago, I was sitting out
with some friends in New York City', 6.273, 10.792, NULL),
  (27969, 138, 'when I got a notification on my phone,', 10.792, 13.167, NULL),
  (27970, 138, 'and I was surprised to find that I had
a text message from my grandmother.', 13.186, 17.965, NULL),
  (27971, 138, 'I was surprised because my grandmother
at the time was 78 years old,', 18.211, 22.535, NULL),
  (27972, 138, 'and she had never sent a text before.', 22.535, 24.519, NULL),
  (27973, 138, 'And I will tell you
the first text was adorable.', 24.986, 27.673, NULL),
  (27974, 138, 'It read, "Dear Andrew,
trying out texting. Love, your grandma."', 27.958, 33.862, NULL),
  (27975, 138, 'I was like "Aw, she thinks it''s a letter!"', 34.652, 37.563, NULL),
  (27976, 138, 'So I sent her a message back,', 38.026, 39.408, NULL),
  (27977, 138, '"Hey grandma, it''s a text.
You don''t have to include all that."', 39.408, 42.362, NULL),
  (27978, 138, 'Her response was "Dear Andrew,', 42.362, 43.835, NULL),
  (27979, 138, 'Okay. Love, your grandma."', 44.425, 47.372, NULL),
  (27980, 138, 'My favorite part is it''s always
"Love, your grandma,"', 47.593, 50.069, NULL),
  (27981, 138, 'like if it was "Love, grandma"
I''d be confused.', 50.161, 52.655, NULL),
  (27982, 138, 'If it was like, "Dear Andrew,
have a good time in Texas. Love, grandma,"', 52.674, 56.056, NULL),
  (27983, 138, 'I''d be like "Grandma? Who''s grandma?"', 56.056, 58.889, NULL),
  (27984, 138, '(Laughter)', 58.889, 59.889, NULL),
  (27985, 138, 'But my grandmother''s still
figuring some things out.', 59.889, 62.321, NULL),
  (27986, 138, 'A couple of years ago,
I went to Switzerland for work,', 62.321, 64.844, NULL),
  (27987, 138, 'came back, sent a message to grandmother:', 64.844, 66.793, NULL),
  (27988, 138, '''''Hey grandma, just got back
from Switzerland.''''', 66.793, 69.040, NULL),
  (27989, 138, 'Her response was, ''''Dear Andrew, 
Switzerland? WTF.''''', 69.040, 73.320, NULL),
  (27990, 138, '(Laughter)', 73.910, 75.926, NULL),
  (27991, 138, 'All right, so I called my grandmother up,', 76.560, 78.592, NULL),
  (27992, 138, '''''Grandma, what do you think WTF means?''''', 78.592, 81.350, NULL),
  (27993, 138, 'And she''s like,', 81.350, 82.347, NULL),
  (27994, 138, '''''Oh well, someone at Bridge told me
it means ''Wow That''s Fun.''''', 82.347, 85.378, NULL),
  (27995, 138, '(Laughter)', 85.378, 87.036, NULL),
  (27996, 138, 'I was like, ''''That is exactly
what it means.''''', 87.036, 89.267, NULL),
  (27997, 138, 'I''m not going to explain that
to my grandmother.', 89.427, 92.212, NULL),
  (27998, 138, 'But over time, I''ve come to realize', 92.212, 93.884, NULL),
  (27999, 138, 'that I think the world
would be a happier place', 93.884, 96.074, NULL),
  (28000, 138, 'if more people thought WTF -', 96.074, 98.206, NULL),
  (28001, 138, 'if more people were like my grandmother
and thought, "Wow, that''s fun."', 98.206, 101.590, NULL),
  (28002, 138, 'Because in 2012, I left my corporate job
at Procter and Gamble', 101.590, 104.861, NULL),
  (28003, 138, 'to teach people about the value of humor.', 104.861, 107.771, NULL),
  (28004, 138, 'I''ve worked with more than 35,000 people
at more than 250 organizations', 107.935, 112.253, NULL),
  (28005, 138, 'on how to be more productive,
less stressed and happier, using humor.', 112.253, 116.532, NULL),
  (28006, 138, 'But when people hear what it is that I do,
